"text":"こないだ外が暖かかったので\n久しぶりに私の大好きな親友と\nお出掛けしてきました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インドア脱出。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ言ってたスニーカー探し！\nお金が足りなくて買えなかった(>_<)\nあと205円...205円あれば...買えた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しかったけど美味しいクレープ\n食べてすぐに元気が出ました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私歩くのとか走るの好きだから\nカフェでまったり♪というよりかは\nいろんな雑貨や服を見ながら\n歩く方が好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩いていろんな裏道回ったりして\n見ているといろんな発見が出来るし\n可愛いお店なども見つけられるし\n最高や〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはこういう息抜きもいいですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会と誕生日は次回！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【朗報】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式プロフィールには身長が\n151cmと書いてありますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"152cm"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))伸びたぞ(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"